Read: the brief, report, plan Task 12c and Calls made, d-2v8vtk, d-znagqe, d-thvvzx, `git show 3134ce5`, `ts/src/app/{threads,held}.ts`, `ts/src/app/ports.ts` (held types), the five new or changed test files.
